    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d98a34ac4ae7908c20b742",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了拯救红色梦想，\n哪怕可能性微乎其微――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a432b440946faef5d328fa56fdd52a4c977991ae8e7a5055380b0c063776d9b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3ce7bdc3f784f0884f257e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不分国内外，翻阅了无数的文献资料，\n竭力寻找着能够帮到红色梦想的一切可能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aad0a4576aeca95547d32ab451a0dc64102fdc802f64ff8646ca69b3a6ba5408",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:763a2ca919d387bc4a8ca86a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终，我找到了某一个唯一的答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbac7494fcf5eb59401b2c2517cb3a7d1aa842210faa6bd877c25de9c6d57853",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
