    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814c5c825b8708e2530a613d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……移居到，美国……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e34541f77db7914f17d786d7855b140429910036423fb6db5ba197a01a0a983a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f30c0cf2f26cc2fb00a14e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种侵蚀马娘的宿疾，\n被认为极难根治，也无法一边参加比赛\n一边进行治疗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0462b0b1e1ebd0666c9e9f353840a197784290def020f6051e81bbc9ff49f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ebddf4115fc49dccc428198",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但在美国，情况却完全不同――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0964e7a0ad44e256c97d24ab22acec3bcad237eed6e944c70db9d6fdefaa49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f6bc736ec5dafb60f00c63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至少在，日本国内是这样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2cb3f72966fe671cc08b55cdee0d7153290246d8be29c1cfe3cf1df17181fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b199822b7dc027a969746bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美国拥有能够对抗『红之楔』的药物。\n那是目前的日本国内\n无法使用的、针对『红之楔』的预防药。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e99eaa31710a1e0d6d67577b770bb4d3d6ec5fc2b607a37da4bc50da468ed5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df03ddbfaeec9f469ce67cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说……虽然在日本困难重重，但只要前往\n美国，通过药物治疗，就有可能在无需恐惧\n疾病复发的情况下，继续在赛场上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abecbcd2a49f2e0c25b86e22500a12bbe8ab4e925bc9d74bb11bb0b134c11d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
